# Skills for this site

Read the skill before writing Vue, CSS, routes, or copy. Do not skip them for "small" page tweaks; those are how look-and-feel drifts.

| Skill | Use when |
|---|---|
| `.cursor/skills/vue3-marketing-site/SKILL.md` | Scaffolding, pages, routing, prerender/SEO, Tailwind 4, TypeScript/`vue-tsc`, forms, deploy, or Vue 3.5 patterns |
| `.cursor/skills/vue3-component-reuse/SKILL.md` | Any new or changed UI: buttons, sections, layout, cards, CTAs |

Do not load FarmBridge/FarmWork app skills (DaisyUI lists, Pinia auth, Laravel) on this site. This is a static marketing site, not an operations app.
